<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Terms & Conditions — Praecheck</title><meta name="description" content="Terms and conditions for Praecheck."><meta name="theme-color" content="#111426"><link rel="icon" href="favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"><script defer src="site-config.js"></script><script defer src="site.js"></script></head><body><header class="site-header"><div class="container nav"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><span class="logo">P</span><span>Praecheck</span></a><nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="index.html#features">Features</a><a href="index.html#how">How it works</a><a href="index.html#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="index.html#faq">FAQ</a><a class="nav-cta" href="contact.html">Contact</a></nav><a class="btn mobile-menu" href="index.html#pricing">Pricing</a></div></header><main class="container legal"><div class="legal-hero"><div class="kicker">Legal</div><h1>Terms & Conditions</h1><p class="updated">Last updated: 15 September 2026</p></div>.</div><p>These terms apply to purchases and use of Praecheck supplied by <span data-company>Praescius Ltd</span>.</p><h2>1. Product</h2><p>Praecheck is an Android data exposure assessment application. It evaluates Core exposure, Data correlation exposure and Known software risks as separate assessment domains using locally available Android state, app metadata and bundled offline advisory data, and provides prioritised findings and practical guidance.</p><h2>2. What Praecheck is not</h2><p>Praecheck is not antivirus software, malware removal software, a forensic examination service or a guarantee that a device is secure. It does not claim to detect spyware, surveillance actors, compromise or every possible form of data collection.</p><h2>3. Licence</h2><p>When you purchase Praecheck Personal, you receive a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence for use on up to 2 personal devices. When you purchase Praecheck Power, you receive the same personal-use software capabilities with activation on up to 10 personal devices. Neither tier grants business, consultant, resale or redistribution rights. Each licence includes 12 months of Praecheck updates from issue; an installed version that is otherwise valid may continue to be used after the included update period ends. You may not resell, sublicense, distribute or make the software or licence file available to others except where applicable law expressly permits.</p><h2>4. Delivery and activation</h2><p>Praecheck is supplied digitally. Delivery instructions and any offline licence file are provided after successful payment. You are responsible for using a compatible Android device and following the installation instructions provided.</p><h2>5. Assessment limitations</h2><p>Android restricts access to some settings and historical information. Praecheck therefore distinguishes observed or granted state from declarations, inferred capability, user-verification items and platform-restricted checks. Core exposure, Data correlation exposure and Known software risks are independent assessment domains. Data correlation findings may describe potential association, profiling, enrichment, commercial-data relevance or bulk-dataset usefulness if relevant data were actually collected, but they do not establish that a specific app or SDK collected, transmitted, sold, shared or commercially exposed data. Known software risk matches identify embedded component versions that match bundled offline advisories and do not by themselves prove reachability, exploitation or compromise.</p>
<p>Third-party product and company names are trademarks of their respective owners. References are used solely for identification and technical analysis and do not imply affiliation, sponsorship or endorsement.</p><h2>6. Updates and assessment history</h2><p>Praecheck Personal and Praecheck Power each include 12 months of updates from licence issue. We may change assessment logic, wording, supported Android versions or scoring methods as the product develops. Praecheck records assessment-model context so comparisons can be limited to compatible assessments; when a check set or scoring methodology changes, a new comparison baseline may be used and historical scores may not be directly comparable.</p><h2>7. Acceptable use</h2><p>You must not use Praecheck in a way that violates applicable law, infringes another person's rights, or attempts to circumvent licence controls. Praecheck is intended for assessment of a device you own or are authorised to assess.</p><h2>8. Consumer rights, cancellation and refunds</h2>

<p>Nothing in these terms limits or excludes any mandatory consumer rights that apply to you, including rights relating to digital content that is faulty, not as described or otherwise does not conform to applicable law.</p>

<p>Where you request immediate supply of Praecheck or its licence file before the end of any statutory cancellation period, you may be asked to expressly consent to supply beginning immediately and to acknowledge that your statutory right to cancel may be lost once supply of the digital content begins.</p>

<p>Our published <a href="https://www.praescius.org.uk/refunds.html">Refund Policy</a> explains our voluntary refund process and does not limit your statutory rights.</p>

<h2>9. Liability</h2><p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Praecheck is supplied without a guarantee that every exposure will be identified or that following a recommendation will eliminate risk. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited.</p><h2>10. Changes</h2><p>We may update these terms for future purchases or software versions. The version applying to your purchase is the version made available at the time of purchase unless law requires otherwise.</p><h2>11. Governing law</h2>

<p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales.</p>

<p>If you are a consumer, this does not deprive you of any mandatory protections available under the law of the country in which you normally reside.</p>

<p>Nothing in these terms limits any right you may have to bring proceedings in a court that has jurisdiction under applicable consumer law.</p>

<h2>12. Contact</h2><p><strong><span data-company>Praescius Ltd</span></strong><br>Registered office: <span data-office></span><br>Company number: <span data-company-number></span><br>Email: <a data-email href="#"></a></p></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-grid"><div><strong>Praecheck</strong><br><span>Android data exposure assessment</span><br><span>© <span data-year></span> <span data-company>Praescius Ltd</span></span></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="terms.html">Terms</a><a href="refunds.html">Refunds</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></div></div></footer></body></html>
